# ValueScope runs without any API keys.
#
# Market data comes from Yahoo Finance (keyless), deep history from the SEC's
# XBRL API (keyless), and earnings call transcripts from the defeatbeta dataset
# on HuggingFace (keyless).

# Optional. Fallback source for earnings call transcripts, used only when the
# primary dataset is unavailable. Free key, email signup, no card:
#   https://www.alphavantage.co/support/#api-key
# Note the free tier allows only 25 requests per day, which is why it is a
# fallback rather than the primary source.
ALPHAVANTAGE_API_KEY=

# Optional. Enables the "Key Takeaways" button on the earnings call page, which
# summarises a transcript with Gemini. Free tier, no card:
#   https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Server-side only — the key is never sent to the browser. Without it the button
# is simply not shown.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
